			Hom.
		</span></i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξεῖνος μέγας ἠδ᾽ εὐπηγής</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wellbuilt, stout</i>, <i><span class="en">
